        "spans_beyond_this_verse": true,
        "translator": "K. M. K. Murthy / Desiraju Hanumanta Rao",
        "text": "\"In valour Rama is comparable to Vishnu, and in his looks he is attractive like the moon, he equals the earth in his forgiveness, but he is matchable to world ending fire in his wrath... and in benevolence he is identical to Kubera, God of Wealth, and in his candour he is like Dharma itself, the Truth personified, with none to rival him... [1-1-18, 19a]"
      }
    ],
